    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/abhinadk.JPG\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 179px;\" /><br /><br />As given in question <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br />From laws of reflection<br /><br /><math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br />Similarly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8214;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br />Again from laws of reflection,<br /><br /><math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math>",
